Z||000001||saleenfiero||08-27-2001||08:50 PM||||What part of this car would still be a fiero and not just a GM sourced mid engined car?  17XX pounds would be insane.  Some of the fiero's charm is from the space frame design which is not light in itself.  It would be cool to see a fiero totally modernized, but I also can't see a quad 4 being the ideal engine for it.  Not with other options available.  Don't get me wrong.  For some reason a stump pulling 350 don't look right in a exotic look alike like the fiero either, but maybe somewhere in between.||||reg||1
